11f\u304c\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\n\u8ca0\u306e\u611f\u60c5\u304b\u3089\u751f\u307e\u308c\u305f\u5f7c\u5973\u306f\u8ca0\u306e\u611f\u60c5\u306b\u60f9\u304b\u308c\u308b\n\u9b54\u6cd5\u304c\u3081\u3061\u3083\u304f\u3061\u3083\u5f37\u3044\u3067\u3059\n\u60aa\u9b54\u306e\u59ff\u3092\u63cf\u3044\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\n\nMyste\uff1a\n\u8eab\u9577\u306f\uff11\uff16\uff16\uff43\uff4d\n\u6027\u683c\u306f\u51b7\u9759\u3067\u30af\u30fc\u30eb\u3002\n\u7a2e\u65cf\u306f\u30a8\u30eb\u30d5\u3002\n\u5f7c\u5973\u306f\u7814\u7a76\u54e1\u3067\u3059\u3001\u30a2\u30ce\u30de\u30ea\u30fc\u30ea\u30b5\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\n\u5dee\u3057\u652f\u3048\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u3001\u79c1\u306eSNS\u3084\u30b5\u30e0\u30cd\u30a4\u30eb\u306b\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u305f\u3044\u306e\u3067\u3001\u3067\u304d\u308c\u3070\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u3092\u5206\u3051\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3051\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b\u3002\n\u627f\u8afe\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3051\u308b\u3068\u5b09\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1V1K3U_OHUzEl0Khsb_A4Jec0_ur6A4m5?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1947451, "client_id": 1188917, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=453ad66fbecd7d6b725da98ebd663b9b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=453ad66fbecd7d6b725da98ebd663b9b, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f87aaaeb4582cbaee7a680e428c56857 2x, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21f4c072457cb517b62a3f2321a3bac2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f0eef30b67731ccf0a5ecff50f99abdb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f0eef30b67731ccf0a5ecff50f99abdb, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2b12290b1a93729fde474168c0f34b10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e068588fe1f1a2ce5ff93d50db28dd17 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Nice to meet you, I adore your art style. I'd like for you to draw my character.\n\n\u25b6Character A (183cm):\nA handsome young detective with a somewhat violent streak. Outwardly a mild-mannered gentleman, his job is to track down spies who have fled from various organizations. He uses binding cords as well as handcuffs for his captors. Broad shoulders. Feel free to draw him with or without the coat, simplifying the details of his outfit is OK. His motifs are \"spider lilies\", \"fireworks\", \"foggy city\" and \"red cords\". Please note the details in the URL.\n\n\u25b6Request details\nPlease draw him looking cool! I leave the pose and composition up to you, however some suggestions for it would be: smoking from a tobacco pipe or kiseru, wiping blood from his face, or adjusting his gloves.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/221k4jpv7mvc", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1947451, "client_id": 1813672, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=337e7394894ac3e5a192f4675ca79188", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=337e7394894ac3e5a192f4675ca79188, https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=273ba7e1c347dfbf233075f07ab789ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74ad66d6bff03262b76d66f6a06f87cb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d813db2cce551ec76f9aa7a005af9224", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d813db2cce551ec76f9aa7a005af9224, https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=210c47b40d83395cea7db42314a27d4b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bb570